cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus, please cite it as below."
title: "Garrusi Kurdish Phase 1 Corpus"
abstract: >-
  A corpus of Garrusi Kurdish (Southern Kurdish) comprising 30 speakers
  and 8,866 transcribed and translated utterances. The corpus consists of
  elicited questionnaire responses and narrative retellings. Each speaker
  is provided as a separate UTF-8 tab-separated file with the Garrusi
  transcript and English translation.
